      "robos:specialAbility": "Holy Smite (3 dice vs visible hero) • Indictment Barrage (move die 1-3 loses action) • Divided Authority (once/battle: lose turn, 2 dice to all adjacent heroes) • Political Infighting (≤3 BP: white shield lets heroes pick special attack)",
      "robos:abilities": "Holy Smite: Attack a visible hero with 3 dice. | Indictment Barrage: Hero rolls movement die; 1–3 loses next action. | Divided Authority: Once per battle, loses its turn but attacks all adjacent heroes with 2 dice. | Political Infighting: At ≤3 BP, roll a combat die at start of turn; on a white shield, heroes choose which available special attack it uses.",
